05||BCD 5 bytes frequency|Send operating frequency|p.106
06||mode byte + optional filter byte|Send operating mode|00 LSB 01 USB 02 AM 03 CW 04 RTTY 05 FM 07 CW-R 08 RTTY-R; filter 01~03 (default filter of mode if omitted); p.106 (no sub-command rows in table)
